  "manual": "Team admin console. People > (a person) > Role sets the person's role in every project of the company. A person's access to one project is set in that project's Members tab (Projects > the project > Members). Suspend account blocks sign-in and keeps the person's files; Remove from team deletes the person's files. Project visibility: Private = project members only; Internal = everyone in the company; Public = anyone with the link, including people outside the company. Archive project makes it read-only and keeps it; Delete project erases it for good. Security > API tokens: Rotate token replaces that one token with a new one; Delete token removes it and breaks what used it; Revoke all tokens breaks every integration. Billing > Seats adds or removes one seat at a time."
 },
